'''Tuttle's office'''<ref name="Graphic Novel">[[The Mandalorian – The Graphic Novel of Season 3|''The Mandalorian'' – The Graphic Novel of Season 3]]</ref> was an office assigned to [[Colonel]] [[Tuttle]] inside the [[New Republic Coruscant skyscraper (Tuttle's office)|New Republic Coruscant skyscraper]] in the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Chapter 21" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate}}</ref> after [[Nevarro]] was attacked by [[pirate]]s, led by [[Gorian Shard]], [[Captain]] [[Carson Teva]] went to Tuttle's office to request immediate backup to liberate Nevaro from the [[Gorian Shard's pirate crew|pirates]]. However, his permit was denied and Teva went to a [[The Tribe|Mandalorian tribe]] to ask for help.<ref name="Chapter 21" />

